{"id":"G2501","lemma":"Ἰωσήφ","transliteration":"iōsēph","sayIt":"IŌSĒPH","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Joseph","meaning":"Ἰωσήφ indecl.\n(FlJ, Ἰώσηπος, -ου), ὁ (Heb. יוֹסֵף),\nJoseph;\n1. the Son of Jacob: Jhn.4:5, Act.7:9, 13-14 7:18, Heb.11:21-22, Rev.7:8.\n2. In the genealogy of our Lord,\n(a) the son of Matthias: Luk.3:24;\n(b) the son Joram: Luk.3:30.\n3. The husband of Mary, the Lord's mother Mat.1:16 ff, Luk.1:27, Jhn.1:46, al.\n4. One of the brethren of our Lord (see: ἀδελφός): Mat.13:55.\n5. Son of Mary: Mat.27:56 (-σῆς, WH, mg., RV).\n6. Joseph of Arimatbæa: Mat.27:57, 59, Mrk.15:43, 45, Luk.23:50, Jhn.19:38.\n7. see: Βαρνάβας.\n8. see: Βαρσαβᾶς\n(AS)","glosses":["joseph","joseph’s","joseph 12,000"],"count":34,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"mat-1","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"Joseph","kjv":"Joseph"}},{"chapterId":"mat-1","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"to Joseph","kjv":"to Joseph"}},{"chapterId":"mat-1","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"Joseph","kjv":"Joseph"}},{"chapterId":"mat-1","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"Joseph","kjv":"Joseph"}},{"chapterId":"mat-1","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"Joseph","kjv":"Joseph"}},{"chapterId":"mat-2","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"to Joseph","kjv":"to Joseph"}},{"chapterId":"mat-2","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"Joseph","kjv":"to Joseph"}},{"chapterId":"mat-13","v":55,"renderings":{"bsb":"Joseph"}},{"chapterId":"mat-27","v":56,"renderings":{"bsb":"Joseph"}},{"chapterId":"mat-27","v":57,"renderings":{"bsb":"Joseph","kjv":"Joseph"}},{"chapterId":"mat-27","v":59,"renderings":{"bsb":"Joseph","kjv":"when Joseph"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-15","v":43,"renderings":{"bsb":"Joseph","kjv":"Joseph"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-15","v":45,"renderings":{"bsb":"to Joseph"}},{"chapterId":"luk-1","v":27,"renderings":{"bsb":"Joseph","kjv":"was Joseph"}},{"chapterId":"luk-2","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"Joseph","kjv":"Joseph"}},{"chapterId":"luk-2","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"Joseph","kjv":"Joseph"}},{"chapterId":"luk-3","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Joseph","kjv":"